Subject: qemu: bound JSON depth for monitor replies

query-block recursively includes backing image metadata. Keep the general JSON
parser's default nesting limit, but allow QMP replies enough bounded depth for
the maximum supported backing chain and its reply envelope.

License: LGPL-2.1-or-later, as in the modified libvirt source files
